        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jooriischooda shirikareeda Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghang'ata hiji gang'uchi Dawdi fuga Filisti ak ghwajoar, ak ghoang'waay Gati sea gharang'weakaaschi aba geatinga fuga Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwajoar Moabu, ak ghoah fuga Moabu fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi nea gweadu gwaadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwajoar Dawdi eara Hadadeseri was sugoocheanda Soba, ea ghwahita Hamati, damanda beawa ghwayiina giirooraneeda ghuuteenda Furati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoareat Dawdi niny mutukwaji sagalama bea ng'ucheeda, ea fih sagalamnyooji ispwa ding'da faraasajeega, ea shirikareeda beawa geeshanga sagalamnyooji diktam; ak ghwalajaada Dawdi geeshanga faraasajeega sean angiir mutukwajeega, ak ghoabuut gea mutukwaji bughala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu fuga Shaamu bea Dameski ghaweat Hadadeseri was sugoocheanda Soba, ghabwar Dawdi fih sagalamnyooji diktam ea iyeenya bea Shaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin Dawdi museasooda aba Shameeda Dameski; ak ghoah fuga Shaamu fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi, nea gweadu gwaadi. Hean ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA Dawdi jooriischooda aba heeda weah sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Dawdi igeambooniga sisna dahaabu siguura dahaabu eada fuga gadiyeeda Hadadeseri, ak gweadu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba Dibhati ea Guni, was mujiinajeega Hadadeseri, ghwaat Dawdi lagheanga oomng'i saang'a; ghayi sina Sulemani basooda lagheanga oomng'i ea daranajeega ea dabita lagheanga oomng'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy Dowu was sugoocheanda Hamati gideaba Dawdi nijoar lugooda sean bea Hadadeseri was sugoocheanda Soba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goojeakta orjeedaanyi siguura Hadoramu gawa heeda sugoocheanda was Dawdi, googeachi niny, nea gagwarsa niny aba gideaba ning'uchi sea Hadadeseri ak ghwajoar; aba gideaba Hadadeseri iissa gang'uchi sea Dowu. Ak gweadu heeluutka haleanjeeda sean bea dahaabu, ea lapiya, ea lagheanga oomng'i; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eara suh ghoadaw sugoocheanda was Dawdi NG'UTAMIIDA, sean shiliingajeega ea dahaabooda ghayi eana eemoojiga sean, eana Edomu, ea Moabu, ea heeda Amoni, ea heeda Filisti, ea heeda Amaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishayi, was orjeeda Seruya ghabwar fih sagalamnyooji damasis bea eemeeda Edomu aba mwangwachiyda Balang'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin museasooda aba Edomu, ak ghoah buuneesean bea Edomu ghoah fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi. Ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA Dawdi jooriischooda aba hiji weah sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goombal Dawdi buuneesean bea Israeli; nea gwasissa buuneeda ng'asheega doabiiw nea ghwanung' gooyang'deay buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yoabu orjeeda Seruya ea haweewa shirikara; nea Yehoshafati orjeeda Ahiludi ea siida apkeatiisa buuneeda ng'asheega askwearjoojiga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Sadoki orjeeda Ahitubu ea Ahimeleki orjeeda Abiyatari ea ashoohoodiga; nea Seraya niny ea siida ng'oorshachi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Benaya orjeeda Yehoyada gwanda madeeda fuga Gereti ea fuga Beleti; nea orjooga Dawdi ea fuga hees bea gadiyeeda sugoocheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
